{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ec837a4a5575cb8cd0cb817e28173ddfdb4f71d2521e5757324c20f8abd11821", "ja": "（今日は朋花の、アイドルとしての初仕事……\n宣材写真撮影だ）", "zh": "（今天是朋花当上偶像后的第一份工作……\n要拍摄宣传照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c364dd2fac6bdc612a402aa4a466152e919412e245baec0713bf1a765d174b1f", "ja": "（撮影の準備は順調に終わった。\nあとは、本番の撮影だけだ！）", "zh": "（拍摄准备都就绪了。\n接下来就只差正式开拍！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "9e86eb76335a839fb114bd8ac064c2714fa2e598348c31d26eeec8bfd05ca514", "ja": "さすが、プロのスタッフさん達ですね～。\n仕事が速くて、的確です～♪", "zh": "不愧是专业的工作人员～\n工作又快又确实～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "782df2706c71439515037193110d7d219bf11bb4949508caefcb944883e78fef", "ja": "（大抵の新人は緊張するのに、この余裕。\n朋花は、大物になるかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（大部分的新人都会紧张，她却这么从容。\n我看朋花可能会成为大人物呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1004_camman", "source_sha256": "6e47e87708eafc4744c200b9d3884774c7649e202df1048b5eecadc2524d5678", "ja": "じゃあ、そろそろ始めましょうか。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "那么，差不多该开拍了吧。\n麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "13e579526743bbdacec7742e42f0cbcf34440d8eea7b2427bb08fa90c936f218", "ja": "その前に……{$P$}さんに\nひとつお願いがあるのですが、いいでしょうか～？", "zh": "在这之前……我有件事想拜托\n{$P$}先生，可以听一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0534cc331dc31816ae276e1df1c67050491628454e71be36251d887db94195eb", "ja": "ん？　いいぞ、なんだ？", "zh": "嗯？可以啊，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "3818a70e74ef0c749dd16d0024bd10d2100611106c2b64b4eef90c39647566a5", "ja": "はい。\n撮影の時に、ポーズの指示をお願いします～♪", "zh": "嗯。\n拜托你在拍摄时，指示我拍照姿势～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "518c7057694548a6785546a95dfc34cd66af0b94f961e806aef1b210258f9717", "ja": "えっ……俺が？　いや、カメラマンさんにも\n考えがあるだろうし、勝手なことをするわけには……。", "zh": "咦……我吗？不，摄影师应该也有自己的考量，\n我不能擅自下指示……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "b20594648d74a06ff3783adb76ffec71dba3eae1664cdea2f406533cae39bd20", "ja": "カメラマンさんの許可は、取ってありますよ～♪", "zh": "我已经取得摄影师的同意啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "d7e35eee730d0e8a9b51411e7685dc64e3bc83baddecea56a97d3ac0ad0c08f3", "ja": "はい！\n面白そうで、いいと思いますよ。", "zh": "是啊！\n感觉很有趣，我觉得没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "076eac1d92d1e6ace13228d12db925815fd9468e35f15af1f88671054738dee9", "ja": "ですので、よろしくお願いします～♪\n{$P$}さんなら、できますよね～？", "zh": "所以说，拜托你了～♪\n{$P$}先生应该做得到吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9f772cec56f37f405a3fef61bc0023bd0a78c5e18a592dcd7bee840578babb80", "ja": "わ、わかった。", "zh": "我、我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4380027c2f6de710a0c568919adf45db0891646599a8bd980b10a3790029f207", "ja": "（こうまで言われたら、やるしかない。\nえっと、朋花らしさを引き立たせるポーズは……）", "zh": "（都说成这样了，不做不行。\n我想想，能衬托朋花特质的姿势是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_1014", "source_sha256": "c661efcfecbcd16fd10efb25e1c92c3bdc3fd7206e1d6f1a0032ede0407c6620", "ja": "知的にして優美に？", "zh": "充满知性又优美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4da728c004cbea287b3cd244d98a2728cbfa258f9a50d66c27a257dd5f5b1adb", "ja": "よし……朋花。片手を、肘の下に当てて……\nもう反対側の手を、顎に当ててみてくれるか？", "zh": "好……朋花。你可以试着把一只手放在手肘下……\n另一只手托着下巴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2001_031tom", "source_sha256": "e21b921de3ee189b3c64c415c3b2699a71fc74999c483e00b801e009ce21ed5d", "ja": "こうですか～？", "zh": "是这样子吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a7842205256590db4da88f901e83e82fab8b3edaaad0084e12ff1f53449eada6", "ja": "うん。それで、笑顔は自然な感じで。\n普段、ファ…子豚ちゃん達に向ける表情がイメージだ。", "zh": "嗯，然后自然地笑。\n想像一下你平常面对粉……小猪们时的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2003_031tom", "source_sha256": "0f91b7e9434022284643b0f64880fdeb73dc09f62aa1eb74bc21c0771aa97c93", "ja": "うふふ、わかりました～♪\nでは、その次のポーズは、どうすればいいですか～？", "zh": "呵呵，我知道了～♪\n那么，接着要摆什么姿势～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "2faf3cdc122cb54ea446317723f3e83fe8bda56d047572909b4f5368de878029", "ja": "（いくつかポーズを指示した後、朋花は撮影に臨んだ。\nその姿は、とても堂々としたものだった）", "zh": "（我指示了几个姿势后，朋花便开始拍照了。\n她的身影看起来充满自信。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2005_031tom", "source_sha256": "c000aa192155d3643ef8bdebe73d181f24b5aba142f3faa6225e355f305867a5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした～。\n完成した写真を見ましたが、素晴らしかったですよ～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了～\n我看过拍好的照片了，拍得很棒喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2006_031tom", "source_sha256": "97e0a829109b480dd6efab061e31cdca3743afda782950917cccf38a6b46ab63", "ja": "カメラマンさんも、どのポーズも的確な指示だったと、\n褒めていました～♪", "zh": "摄影师也说每个姿势都指示得很明确，\n夸了你一番呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2007_p", "source_sha256": "96828a56c35a561a288757d1f9891bcf3838081ed5fef048b6c4019cf1ddda97", "ja": "それならよかった……。\nけど朋花、どうして俺に指示を出させたんだ？", "zh": "那就好……\n可是朋花，为什么要叫我来下指示啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2008_031tom", "source_sha256": "8ba50c7bc3cca7b669cece53cd97a27bf317cf7f292723f1049a7c37cbc33061", "ja": "もちろん、できると思ったからですよ～♪", "zh": "当然是因为觉得你办得到啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2009_031tom", "source_sha256": "88fecb1f14be5a5ab5a1a3059ad9982ce54a5d7b03b281983f0024d6acc68dc4", "ja": "何故かというと……{$P$}さんは、\n私のプロデューサーですからね～。", "zh": "要说原因的话……因为{$P$}先生\n是我的制作人嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2010_031tom", "source_sha256": "fb553b06a6b63539cd24cbc6a1f24b9a3900ec4b93347bdf0a48f359c95c11f8", "ja": "私の魅力を引き出す方法を一番よく知っていて、\n当然ではありませんか～？", "zh": "你最清楚能衬托我魅力的方式，\n这也是应该的吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "145f5a6593224f621bab271a34cb9324f71c5513c1b39957e3e11ce5bce819b0", "ja": "……そうだな。その通りだ。", "zh": "……是啊，你说得没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2012_031tom", "source_sha256": "71bcfdf70b13cdf1feeafe05e46c6c742a688600d80d644710cd7619554f7bec", "ja": "うふふ。これからも、この調子で頑張ってくださいね？\n{$P$}さん～♪", "zh": "呵呵，今后也请你像这样继续努力下去啰～\n{$P$}先生～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2013_p", "source_sha256": "2e18933ec3a17b8fbe6c5ee515aaf81ccffc3206691d6ec9878f033cc887e4b5", "ja": "（なるほど。これは、朋花のプロデューサーとして、\n相応しいかどうか試されていた……ということかな）", "zh": "（原来如此。她是在测试我\n身为朋花的制作人是否称职……吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_031tom_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_002_2014_p", "source_sha256": "3b9779daa3224a5df75a201416ac275ea72f48d8da4bd9d8ee6461b4162dc7c4", "ja": "（うーん、さすがの貫禄だ！\nはは、今後も気を抜かないようにしないとな）", "zh": "（唔──这股威严真不是盖的！\n哈哈，我今后也不能掉以轻心呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
